{
  "actors": [
    {
      "id": "phone",
      "label": "Driver's phone",
      "role": "client",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "cdn",
      "label": "CDN",
      "role": "edge",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "label": "Gateway",
      "role": "edge",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 16
    },
    {
      "id": "router",
      "label": "Route service (west region)",
      "role": "compute",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "weights",
      "label": "Traffic weights",
      "role": "data",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "probes",
      "label": "Probe queue",
      "role": "async",
      "x": 14,
      "y": 50
    },
    {
      "id": "eta",
      "label": "ETA service",
      "role": "compute",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "label": "Navigation push",
      "role": "edge",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 84
    }
  ],
  "frames": [
    {
      "narration": "The driver opens the map. The phone asks for the tiles of the area on screen, each addressed by zoom, x and y. The CDN has almost all of them cached and answers without touching the origin.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "phone",
          "to": "cdn",
          "label": "20 tiles, zoom 14"
        },
        {
          "from": "cdn",
          "to": "phone",
          "label": "vector tiles from cache"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "cdn": "hit rate 95%"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "The driver asks for a route of 60 km. The gateway sends the query to the route service that owns the start region.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "phone",
          "to": "api",
          "label": "route A to B"
        },
        {
          "from": "api",
          "to": "router",
          "label": "query for region west"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "api": "region west chosen"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "The route service reads the current weights of the roads in the area. The hierarchy for this region keeps its structure, and only the shortcut weights were recomputed for the latest snapshot.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "router",
          "to": "weights",
          "label": "current weights"
        },
        {
          "from": "weights",
          "to": "router",
          "label": "snapshot of minute 0"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "weights": "snapshot, 1 minute old"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "The search goes upward in rank from both ends and meets after about 1,000 settled nodes, under a millisecond. Plain Dijkstra would have settled about 450,000. The route takes 41 minutes with the traffic at departure.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "router",
          "to": "api",
          "label": "route, 41 min"
        },
        {
          "from": "api",
          "to": "phone",
          "label": "route and ETA 41 min"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "router": "1,000 nodes settled"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "While driving, the phone reports its position every 5 seconds. The reports of all drivers go into a queue, and a stream job turns them into the speed of each road segment over the last minute.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "phone",
          "to": "probes",
          "label": "position every 5 s"
        },
        {
          "from": "probes",
          "to": "weights",
          "label": "speed per segment"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "weights": "new snapshot, minute 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "Traffic builds up ahead. At the next refresh the ETA service prices the rest of the route with the expected speed at the time the driver will reach each part, and finds that the ETA is now 52 minutes. A search from the current position finds a route that takes 44.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "eta",
          "to": "weights",
          "label": "speeds ahead"
        },
        {
          "from": "eta",
          "to": "router",
          "label": "alternative from here"
        },
        {
          "from": "router",
          "to": "eta",
          "label": "route, 44 min"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "eta": "52 min now, 44 on detour"
      }
    },
    {
      "narration": "The saving of 8 minutes is above the threshold of 2 minutes and 10%, and the detour is not shared by too many other drivers, so the navigation push service tells the phone to switch.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "from": "eta",
          "to": "nav",
          "label": "reroute, save 8 min"
        },
        {
          "from": "nav",
          "to": "phone",
          "label": "take exit 12"
        }
      ],
      "states": {
        "nav": "reroute sent",
        "phone": "on detour, ETA 44 min"
      },
      "highlight": [
        "phone"
      ]
    }
  ]
}